referenceFunction.generalComment:
This dataset can be used in the construction building sector. The cutting of the extruded polystyrene blocks is not included in the process. Blowing agent shares are 50% (w/w) CO2, 25% (w/w) HFC-134a and 25% (w/w) HFC-152a.;
Synonyms: XPS; 
